      "behavior": "kmctl doctor's antigravity.apm-hooks fails, naming .agents/hooks.json, that it is not a JSON object, and a fix to repair the file by hand and run kmctl plugin install --harness antigravity, when that file does not parse; it passes for a parsed file whose handlers do not run okf-stop-check.sh, even when the text mentions it elsewhere; and it still fails, naming kmctl plugin install --harness antigravity, for a handler that runs it.",
